Addresses code review feedback to make sequence filtering explicit rather than implicit within foreach loops.

### Changes

**`TableOfContentsGenerator.cs::HasVisibleContent()`**

Replaced foreach loops with implicit condition checks with explicit LINQ filtering:

```csharp
// Before
foreach (var entry in topic.Entries)
{
    if (!IsFileIgnored(entry.File, ignoreFiles))
    {
        return true;
    }
}

// After
if (topic.Entries.Where(entry => !IsFileIgnored(entry.File, ignoreFiles)).Any())
{
    return true;
}
```

Applied the same pattern to subtopic filtering, improving code clarity and following C# idiomatic patterns.

